        <briefdescription>
<para>Register a sink callback invoked for every new event. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The callback is called <emphasis>outside</emphasis> the internal mutex, so it may safely call back into the log (e.g., to read stats). Only one callback can be registered at a time; a second call replaces the previous one.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>cb</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Callable receiving a const-reference to the new event. Pass nullptr to clear the callback. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
